  "inverse_decay_quadrature_method": "Gauss-Legendre orders 16,32,64 on the Dalitz region where E1 is smallest, multiplied by 3; split E1 ranges [0,1/4] and [1/4,1/3]. E2 in [max(1/2-E1,E1),min(1/2,1-2E1)]. Average over cos(theta) with same order and phi with 2*order midpoint nodes; boost energies to the bath frame. Integrand product n_B(Ei)/(64*pi^3*E_X).",
  "scattering_quadrature_method": "For each bath channel integrate incoming bath momentum k=u/(1-u), u in [0,1], cos(theta) in [-1,1], with Gauss-Legendre quadrature. Outgoing two-body phase space and its Bose factors are integrated analytically, as documented in inclusive_x.md.",
